{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About this demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo lets you experience the first 10 rounds of the game, giving you a taste of what's to come. You'll have the opportunity to recruit troops, purchase weapons and armor, and get familiar with the core gameplay mechanics. Along the way, you'll encounter a selection of enemy troops\u2014representing some of the unit types available in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the 10th round, you'll face off against a randomly selected boss, offering a glimpse of the challenges that lie ahead. Once you've successfully completed the 10th wave, the demo will come to an end.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588690?t=1744348273","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3588690?t=1744348273","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588690/0cc7c352bd0997086c49dda9487a152599572444/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744348273","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588690/0cc7c352bd0997086c49dda9487a152599572444/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744348273","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About this demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo lets you experience the first 10 rounds of the game, giving you a taste of what's to come. You'll have the opportunity to recruit troops, purchase weapons and armor, and get familiar with the core gameplay mechanics. Along the way, you'll encounter a selection of enemy troops\u2014representing some of the unit types available in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the 10th round, you'll face off against a randomly selected boss, offering a glimpse of the challenges that lie ahead. Once you've successfully completed the 10t